# Bloodmoon "Making a Choice": once the supply ship is found, Falco asks the
# player to help him keep Carnius in check. The player sides with Falco
# (ColonySide 1), which routes every later assignment through him.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_co_survivor --timeout 2400
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case co_choice
run
player->Position -197200 160250 870 0
until 600 "Falco Galenus"->GetDistance player < 400
talk Falco Galenus
ask crossroads
ask aiding me
expect GetJournalIndex CO_Choice == 22
ask aiding me
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex CO_Choice == 40
expect ColonySide == 1
bye
end
